uinan_reading":"m-xu-wife"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-011","source_id":"s-nanshi-011-luhuinan-ws2288359","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p002","quote":"孝建二年，追贈太后父興之散騎常侍，興之妻余杭縣廣昌鄉君。大明四年，太后弟子撫軍參軍瓊之上表自陳。有司承旨，奏贈瓊之父道慶給事中，瓊之及弟休之、茂之並居顯職。太后頗豫政事，賜與瓊之等財物，家累千金，居處器服與帝子相侔。大明五年，太后隨上巡南豫州，妃主以下並從。廢帝立，號太皇太后。明帝踐阼，號崇憲太后。","subject_person_reference_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p002:r0019","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p002:m0017","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-011-luhuinan:p002","surface":"興之妻","start":17,"end":20}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"南史只記興之妻；宋書同句具姓徐。兩書均不明言她是惠男生母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nanshi011-luhuinan-s-xu-wife","subject_person_id":"4p2_s17_v1v","object_person_id":"sde_n8n_9ko","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"興之妻","nanshi011_luhuinan_reading":"s-xu-wife"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-luhuinan-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003","quote":"孝建二年，追贈太后父興之散騎常侍，興之妻徐氏餘杭縣廣昌鄉君。大明四年，太后弟子撫軍參軍瓊之上表曰：「先臣故懷安令道慶賦命乖辰，自違明世。敢緣衞戍請名之典，特乞雲雨，微垂灑潤。」詔付門下。有司承旨奏贈給事中。瓊之及弟休之、茂之並超顯職。太后頗豫政事，賜與瓊之等財物，家累千金，居處服器，與帝子相侔。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0020","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0017","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003","surface":"興之妻","start":17,"end":20}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"南史只記興之妻；宋書同句具姓徐。兩書均不明言她是惠男生母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-041-luhuinan:p003:m0020","surface":"徐氏","start":20,"end":22,"person_id":"4p2_s17_v1v","kind":"person","status"